.TH ferry-discover 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-discover \- Search for Ferry devices on the local network (own UDP broadcast, no mDNS)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry discover\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search for Ferry devices on the local network (own UDP broadcast, no mDNS)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<TIMEOUT>\fR [default: 5]
Search duration in seconds
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
